  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD渲染半径（区块）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons的渲染距离，以区块为单位。\n\n注意：这是尽量达到的目标值。\n受其他图形设置影响，实际渲染距离可能高于或低于此值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD画质递减间距",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD画质每次降低一级之间的距离。\n\n提高此项会增大递减间距，\n但也会增加内存和GPU占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平分辨率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD能够渲染的最高细节水平。\n\n§6最快：§r区块\n§6最精细：§r方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD表现悬空地形、洞穴、峭壁等结构的精细程度。\n\n提高此项会增加内存和GPU占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "按镜头位置计算画质递减",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "启用后，DH会尝试按镜头位置计算LOD画质递减；\n禁用时使用玩家位置。\n\n启用有助于自由镜头模组正确渲染。\n禁用有助于多镜头模组正确渲染（如Immersive Portals或相机模组）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "放大视野时提高画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "启用后，使用望远镜或缩放模组等方式放大视野时，LOD画质也会提高。\n\n仅影响镜头视野内的LOD。\n放大时，LOD会加载到接近观察它们时相同的细节水平。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "放大时最多提高的细节级数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "放大视野最多可以使LOD提高多少个细节等级。\n较大的数值能让高倍率下的地形更清晰，但会增加放大时的内存和GPU占用。\n\n原版望远镜需要提高4级才能达到完整画质。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平缩放",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "LOD画质随距离降低的速度。\n\n数值越大，远处地形越精细，\n但内存和GPU占用也越高。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明效果",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD着色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "设置LOD的着色方式。\n可用于改善光影兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草方块侧面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "草方块LOD的侧面与底面应如何渲染？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "淡出附近的DH LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "启用后，LOD会在你靠近时逐渐消失。\n禁用时，LOD会在距镜头指定距离处突然消失。\n此设置受原版重复绘制防护配置影响。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "原版淡出模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "原版Minecraft地形应如何过渡到Distant Horizons LOD？\n\nNONE：最快，DH与原版渲染之间有明显边界。\nSINGLE_PASS：在原版透明渲染阶段之后淡出，水下不透明方块不会淡出。\nDOUBLE_PASS：最慢，在原版不透明和透明渲染阶段之后分别淡出，过渡最平滑。",
