  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "加宽远处信标光柱",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "启用后，极远处的LOD信标光柱会加宽，以便看清。\n禁用时，所有LOD信标光柱始终只有1格宽。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "启用后会渲染LOD信标光柱。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "启用云渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "启用后会渲染LOD云。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "启用云的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "DH应渲染云的维度资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n修改后需重新加载世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "启用多层云",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "禁用：像原版Minecraft一样只渲染一层云。\n启用：在不同高度渲染3层云。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "启用Distant Horizons雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "是否在DH LOD上绘制雾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "雾色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD上雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "启用原版雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6启用：§rMinecraft正常渲染雾。\n§6禁用：§r关闭原版区块上的Minecraft雾。\n\n可能与其他修改雾效果的模组冲突。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "高级雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "雾从哪里开始？\n\n0.0：从玩家位置开始。\n1.0：雾起点构成的圆内切于LOD渲染距离构成的正方形。\n1.414：LOD渲染距离构成的正方形内接于雾起点构成的圆。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "雾在哪里达到终点？\n\n0.0：终点位于玩家位置。\n1.0：雾终点构成的圆内切于LOD渲染距离构成的正方形。\n1.414：LOD渲染距离构成的正方形内接于雾终点构成的圆。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "最小雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小浓度。\n\n0.0：完全没有雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "最大雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大浓度。\n\n0.0：完全没有雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：随距离线性变化（忽略density）。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2))",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity": "雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "雾的密度是多少？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "高度雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度雾混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "设置高度对雾的影响。\n不确定时，可以先尝试SPHERICAL、ADDITION或MAX。\n\nSPHERICAL：按镜头距离计算雾。\nCYLINDRICAL：忽略高度，按水平距离计算雾。\nMAX：max(heightFog, farFog)\nADDITION：heightFog + farFog\nMULTIPLY：heightFog * farFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY：1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nLIMITED_ADDITION：farFog + max(farFog, heightFog)\nMULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + farFog * heightFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nAVERAGE：farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "高度雾方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "高度雾应出现在哪里？\n\nABOVE_CAMERA：从镜头向天空延伸。\nBELOW_CAMERA：从镜头向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：从镜头向天空和虚空两侧延伸。\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空延伸。\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空和虚空两侧延伸。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度雾基准高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "如果围绕指定高度计算高度雾，应使用哪个高度？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "高度雾起点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：起点不偏移。\n1.0：起点偏移整个世界的高度（包括深度）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "高度雾终点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：终点不偏移。\n1.0：终点偏移整个世界的高度（包括深度）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "高度雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小浓度。\n\n0.0：完全没有雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "高度雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大浓度。\n\n0.0：完全没有雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算高度雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：随高度线性变化（忽略density）。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(height*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((height*density)^2))",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "高度雾的密度是多少？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "启用LOD纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "启用后，附近和视野放大后的LOD会使用方块实际的纹理与轮廓，而非单一纯色。\n\n仅适用于纹理实际可见的高细节LOD，远处LOD仍使用纯色。\n启用光影包时无效，因为光影包使用自己的程序渲染LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "纹理渲染细节等级上限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "允许使用方块纹理的最大细节等级编号。\n等级编号越大，每个LOD覆盖的方块越多，纹理可能小于一个像素而不可见。\n\n较大的值会为更远处的LOD添加纹理，但也会增加内存占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不渲染纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH不应渲染纹理的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n支持部分匹配和不完整资源标识。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH应使用底面纹理绘制侧面的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n支持部分匹配和不完整资源标识。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块标签",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH应使用底面纹理绘制侧面的方块标签列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n\n例如：\"grass_blocks,nylium\"\n\n修改后需重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "始终光栅化纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH应通过光栅化确定表面纹理的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n\n可修复某些模组方块的表面只使用模型纹理一部分时出现的问题。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:beacon\"\n\n修改后需重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "启用噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "启用后，在LOD上叠加噪声以模拟纹理。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "噪声级数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "设置应用于LOD的噪声级数。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "噪声强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "噪声淡出距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "噪声纹理在多远处淡出，以方块为单位。\n设为0可禁用淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "避免重复绘制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "设置Distant Horizons从距镜头多远处开始渲染，数值为原版渲染距离的比例。\n-1 = 自动，随原版渲染距离调整。\n\n较大的值会在更远处避免于原版方块后方绘制LOD，但可能使LOD出现空洞。\n飞过未加载地形时最容易出现空洞。\n\n提高原版渲染距离可以增强此设置的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "快速移动时缩小重复绘制防护范围",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "启用后，快速飞行或移动时，避免重复绘制的半径会向镜头靠近。\n\n这有助于缓解原版区块加载或生成速度跟不上DH的问题。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "启用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "启用后会剔除洞穴。\n\n附加说明：目前会在没有天花板的维度中，剔除洞穴剔除高度以下、天空光照为0的所有表面。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "从哪个Y坐标开始进行洞穴剔除？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "启用信标距离剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "启用后，镜头附近的信标不会由DH绘制，以避免与原版重复绘制。\n禁用时会渲染所有信标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "禁用视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "禁用阴影阶段视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略的方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "DH不应渲染的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在内。\n\n注意：如果出现缝隙或空洞，可能需要将worldCompression改为[MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS]，并重新生成LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "洞穴中忽略的方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "在地下天空光照为0的区域内不应渲染的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在内。\n\n默认列表为空，因为多数洞穴方块已因透明、无实体碰撞或属于液体而被忽略；如有需要，可在此添加其他方块。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水下表面替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "位于水面且可见时应被水替换的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "位于水上方时应被移除的方块资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "忽略的方块类型",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "设置哪些方块应渲染为LOD。\n\n§6NONE：§r包含所有方块。\n§6NON_COLLIDING：§r仅渲染实体方块（忽略高草、火把等）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "使用被忽略方块的颜色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：会让雪、地毯和活板门看起来很糟糕§r\n是否用被忽略方块的颜色给其下方方块着色？\n§6启用：§r草方块上的红花会将下方草方块染红。\n§6禁用：§r被跳过的方块不会改变下方表面的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "覆盖原版设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "启用后，DH初始化时会自动调整部分原版图形设置，以改善体验。\n\n例如禁用原版云（会盖在DH LOD上方）和区块淡入淡出（DH已提供原版区块过渡）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "设为假时，不绘制镜头视野之外的LOD，可改善GPU性能。\n\n设为真时，所有LOD都会绘制，包括镜头后方的LOD，会降低GPU性能。\n\n如果视野边缘的LOD异常消失，可将此项设为真以关闭视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "与普通视锥剔除选项相同，但仅在使用DH API的光影模组执行阴影渲染阶段时生效。\n\n如果阴影渲染异常，可尝试关闭阴影阶段的视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental": "实验性功能",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "值为1时相当于现实地球的曲率。\n接受的最小值为50，最大值为5000。\n1到49之间的值都会向上调整为50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "DH不应渲染的维度资源标识列表，以英文逗号分隔。例如：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n对于Minecraft 1.12.2及更早版本：\n打开F3界面，复制黄色显示的dimension_name:ID。例如：\"overworld:0\"\n\n注意：禁用DH渲染时，部分DH设置会被关闭或调整，以改善显示效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "修改后需重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater": "自动更新器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableAutoUpdater": "启用自动更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates": "启用静默更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates.@tooltip": "有可用更新时自动更新模组",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch": "更新分支",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch.@tooltip": "从哪里下载更新？\n\n自动：根据当前JAR选择稳定版或每夜构建版。\n稳定版：Modrinth上的稳定构建。\n每夜构建版：GitLab上的每夜构建。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人游戏",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "服务器文件夹模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "设置多人游戏数据在本地保存时的文件夹命名格式。\n\n§6仅名称：§r\n使用服务器列表中的名称，例如“Minecraft Server”。\n§6仅IP：§r\n“192.168.1.40”\n§6名称与IP：§r\n“Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40”\n§6名称、IP、端口：§r\n“Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565”\n§6名称、IP、端口、MC版本：§r\n“Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1”\n\n§c§l注意：§r连接到多人服务器期间修改此项可能导致异常。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging": "调试",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.rendererMode": "渲染器模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugRenderingColors": "调试渲染颜色",
